WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.985 --> 00:00:05.005
(intense music)

00:00:05.005 --> 00:00:06.665
- [Competitor] Nailed it.

00:00:06.665 --> 00:00:08.330
(laughing)

00:00:08.330 --> 00:00:09.330
- [Nicole] I don't mean to laugh

00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:11.680
but your princess is terrifying.

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:14.060
She is so scary looking

00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:17.940
and I don't think anybody's
coming to rescue her.

00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:21.023
Oh no, and then your
dragon got decapitated.

00:00:21.023 --> 00:00:21.856
- [Competitor] Yes.

00:00:21.856 --> 00:00:24.607
(sorrowful music)

00:00:24.607 --> 00:00:26.820
- But I love this cake so much.

00:00:26.820 --> 00:00:29.701
- The princess is a little
bit scary, the eyes!

00:00:29.701 --> 00:00:33.177
(alarming music)

00:00:33.177 --> 00:00:35.430
- [Jacques] Those big
eyes, she just woke up.

00:00:35.430 --> 00:00:37.863
- What voice do you
think your princess has?

00:00:38.840 --> 00:00:39.673
- Hi guys.

00:00:41.615 --> 00:00:43.290
You need to kill that dragon.

00:00:43.290 --> 00:00:44.633
Off with his head.

00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:47.990
- So her voice matches her face.

00:00:47.990 --> 00:00:50.110
If you stare in her eyes, you'll get-

00:00:50.110 --> 00:00:53.183
- Nope, no, thank you, I won't do it.

00:00:55.401 --> 00:00:56.651
- [Competitor] Nailed it!

00:00:57.514 --> 00:00:59.750
(laughing)

00:00:59.750 --> 00:01:01.710
- [Nicole] That looks
like some strange fish

00:01:01.710 --> 00:01:03.830
from the bottom of the deep, deep ocean.

00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:05.300
- It's like snake fish.

00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:06.840
- [Nicole] I love those teeth.

00:01:06.840 --> 00:01:08.590
- But, you were really innovative,

00:01:08.590 --> 00:01:10.630
and you covered it and moved on.

00:01:10.630 --> 00:01:12.800
That's exactly what I would do.

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:13.653
- Nailed it!

00:01:14.893 --> 00:01:16.233
- How is that possible?

00:01:18.850 --> 00:01:22.190
- Oh no, he's got a happy face there.

00:01:22.190 --> 00:01:23.702
- It's not a happy face, it's a--

00:01:23.702 --> 00:01:24.535
(emoji boings)

00:01:24.535 --> 00:01:27.091
- Just be happy I knew
it was a happy face.

00:01:27.091 --> 00:01:29.980
May I ask, what had
happened to your fondant?

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:32.500
- Okay so, Toy was kind
enough to give me her fondant

00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:34.620
so with five seconds left I just

00:01:34.620 --> 00:01:36.010
threw that fondant on there.

00:01:36.010 --> 00:01:38.160
But, I'm almost positive
my art teacher license

00:01:38.160 --> 00:01:40.210
is gonna get revoked after this.

00:01:41.300 --> 00:01:44.830
- I'm pretty blown away
but fascinated as well,

00:01:44.830 --> 00:01:48.053
and the arms are really weirding me out.

00:01:48.890 --> 00:01:50.460
- You understand that
the arms are longer than

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:51.389
the legs?

00:01:51.389 --> 00:01:52.946
- Oh yeah, yeah!

00:01:52.946 --> 00:01:55.923
(drum roll)

00:01:55.923 --> 00:01:58.330
- [Competitor] Nailed it.

00:01:58.330 --> 00:02:00.360
- [Nicole] I don't mean to laugh,

00:02:00.360 --> 00:02:02.393
but what is happening?

00:02:03.960 --> 00:02:06.630
Ooh girl it is leaning.

00:02:06.630 --> 00:02:08.210
- Well I overfilled my cakes

00:02:08.210 --> 00:02:10.050
and it took way too long for them to bake.

00:02:10.050 --> 00:02:12.140
And then, they were too hot
and I didn't have enough time

00:02:12.140 --> 00:02:14.802
to really cool them down
before I started icing things.

00:02:14.802 --> 00:02:16.823
- (laughs) Okay.

00:02:19.014 --> 00:02:22.106
- Oh no.

00:02:22.106 --> 00:02:23.430
- Uh oh.

00:02:23.430 --> 00:02:25.070
- [Guest judge] Not quite.

00:02:25.070 --> 00:02:25.903
- Uh oh.

00:02:25.903 --> 00:02:26.736
- Are you sure?

00:02:26.736 --> 00:02:28.180
- Oh no Heather.

00:02:28.180 --> 00:02:29.596
- Try a little bit more.

00:02:29.596 --> 00:02:30.429
- Uh oh.

00:02:30.429 --> 00:02:31.607
- Maybe some more icing.

00:02:31.607 --> 00:02:32.524
- Uh oh.

00:02:32.524 --> 00:02:34.909
- The cake is still warm.

00:02:34.909 --> 00:02:36.826
The cake is still warm!

00:02:38.504 --> 00:02:40.110
- Alright Will.

00:02:40.110 --> 00:02:42.963
Let's see your recreation
of a barbecue cake.

00:02:45.170 --> 00:02:46.253
- [Will] Nailed it.

00:02:47.510 --> 00:02:51.810
♪ If it don't feel right then it's wrong ♪

00:02:51.810 --> 00:02:53.440
- [Nicole] This is wild.

00:02:53.440 --> 00:02:54.820
- This wild cake

00:02:55.950 --> 00:02:58.430
is the result of two solid hours

00:02:58.430 --> 00:03:00.250
of blood sweat and tears.

00:03:00.250 --> 00:03:01.958
- [Jacques] And the spatula looks real!

00:03:01.958 --> 00:03:03.485
- It's great cause the spatula's so real.

00:03:03.485 --> 00:03:05.520
- So, I didn't want to leave anything out.

00:03:05.520 --> 00:03:08.740
I didn't have enough time
to make a spatula but,

00:03:08.740 --> 00:03:13.280
I had a spatula on hand so I
just went with the pre-made.

00:03:13.280 --> 00:03:15.680
You can't eat it though, sorry.

00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:18.780
- Oh my god this cake is incredible.

00:03:18.780 --> 00:03:19.840
I love it so much.

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:21.773
Please, I love it so much.

00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:28.550
If someone made this into
a hat, I would wear it.

00:03:32.330 --> 00:03:33.263
- Nailed it.

00:03:34.200 --> 00:03:35.033
- Alright.

00:03:37.160 --> 00:03:40.375
I know you had trouble,
put his head back on.

00:03:40.375 --> 00:03:41.260
- [Competitor] So, I mean--

00:03:41.260 --> 00:03:42.763
- Can you say nailed it again?

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:45.290
- Nailed it!

00:03:45.290 --> 00:03:47.960
(laughing)

00:03:47.960 --> 00:03:49.097
- [Nicole] Oh Evelyn.

00:03:50.150 --> 00:03:51.673
I like the straw arms!

00:03:52.861 --> 00:03:53.694
(cake squishes)

00:03:53.694 --> 00:03:54.533
- Oh no!

00:03:58.992 --> 00:04:01.075
- [Competitor] Nailed it.

00:04:03.670 --> 00:04:05.800
- [Nicole] I love this so much.

00:04:05.800 --> 00:04:09.280
What a treat, he's like
(imitates croaking)

00:04:09.280 --> 00:04:11.430
- Where is the top of his mouth?

00:04:11.430 --> 00:04:12.530
I see the bottom.

00:04:12.530 --> 00:04:13.580
- Yeah, so this is the bottom.

00:04:13.580 --> 00:04:14.760
Here is the top.

00:04:14.760 --> 00:04:15.593
- How can he chew?

00:04:15.593 --> 00:04:16.426
- He's got an underbite.

00:04:17.299 --> 00:04:19.620
- Oh okay I understand.
- He needs braces.

00:04:19.620 --> 00:04:20.805
- Nailed it!

00:04:20.805 --> 00:04:21.638
- [Judges] Whoa!

00:04:21.638 --> 00:04:22.987
- [Jacques] It's moving!

00:04:22.987 --> 00:04:23.820
- No!

00:04:26.110 --> 00:04:29.040
Christian, this is my
favorite thing I've ever seen!

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:32.010
- It's all kind of abstract art.

00:04:32.010 --> 00:04:35.060
- I don't mean to laugh but her lips.

00:04:35.060 --> 00:04:38.750
- I had like two seconds
so I had to improvise.

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:41.533
- The gold that's just
slapped on her face.

00:04:44.160 --> 00:04:45.410
- [Competitor] Nailed it!

00:04:46.456 --> 00:04:49.456
(suspenseful music)

00:04:50.670 --> 00:04:51.503
- [Jay] Wow.

00:04:51.503 --> 00:04:55.120
- [Nicole] Oh you're dancing, okay, wow.

00:04:55.120 --> 00:04:57.130
- You would dance too if you nailed it.

00:04:57.130 --> 00:04:58.820
- You're right I would.

00:04:58.820 --> 00:05:01.323
That is so, (mumbling)

00:05:05.730 --> 00:05:07.620
it's good, there we go.

00:05:07.620 --> 00:05:09.310
I got there, it's good.

00:05:09.310 --> 00:05:10.993
The hair is great.

00:05:10.993 --> 00:05:12.717
- He's got the flyaway like real life.

00:05:12.717 --> 00:05:13.550
- Mhm.

00:05:13.550 --> 00:05:15.720
What is going on with
the red around his eyes?

00:05:15.720 --> 00:05:17.380
- [Jacques] One eye,
actually, is looking at me.

00:05:17.380 --> 00:05:18.923
One eye is looking at Jay.

00:05:19.820 --> 00:05:21.960
- Your Trump looks like the stress has

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:23.630
really gotten to him.

00:05:23.630 --> 00:05:25.197
- I gave you guys the real deal.

00:05:25.197 --> 00:05:26.653
(drum roll)

00:05:26.653 --> 00:05:28.736
- [Competitor] Nailed it.

00:05:30.060 --> 00:05:32.663
- [Nicole] Speechless, floored.

00:05:34.070 --> 00:05:38.530
- I love the horn, but
what happened to the cake?

00:05:38.530 --> 00:05:40.310
- I felt good and confident,

00:05:40.310 --> 00:05:42.080
and then it was like a roller coaster.

00:05:42.080 --> 00:05:45.310
It just went, I'm all right,
I'm cool and then I don't know.

00:05:45.310 --> 00:05:47.233
Everything else was a blur.

00:05:47.233 --> 00:05:48.250
- [Competitor] Nailed it!

00:05:48.250 --> 00:05:49.083
- Oh boy.

00:05:50.340 --> 00:05:52.040
I like him.

00:05:52.040 --> 00:05:55.420
He looks like he's pondering his mortality

00:05:55.420 --> 00:05:58.910
as he sinks into a bed of leaves.

00:05:58.910 --> 00:06:00.653
- [Guest Judge] Oh look at his hand!

00:06:01.587 --> 00:06:03.180
- Got some serious claws going on.

00:06:03.180 --> 00:06:05.180
- Looks like some
osteoporosis or something

00:06:05.180 --> 00:06:06.659
in the hand.

00:06:06.659 --> 00:06:07.843
- [Competitor] Nailed it!

00:06:08.783 --> 00:06:09.616
- Wow.

00:06:12.606 --> 00:06:14.250
- [Guest Judge] Wow, wow, wow.

00:06:14.250 --> 00:06:16.610
- Your cake has made me make a noise

00:06:16.610 --> 00:06:17.827
I've never made before.

00:06:18.946 --> 00:06:20.580
I love these eyebrows.

00:06:20.580 --> 00:06:22.940
Oh my goodness, I love his taco hat.

00:06:22.940 --> 00:06:24.650
I love that he doesn't have no eyes,

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:26.590
doesn't have no nose.

00:06:26.590 --> 00:06:27.860
- One particular thing, I love

00:06:27.860 --> 00:06:29.347
the little gold dots coming down.

00:06:29.347 --> 00:06:30.180
- Oh, thank you.

00:06:30.180 --> 00:06:31.310
- [Guest Judge] That's
kind of really cool.

00:06:31.310 --> 00:06:32.480
- [Nicole] Jacques, what do you think?

00:06:32.480 --> 00:06:36.023
- So, I think that Napoleon
looks like that now.

00:06:38.450 --> 00:06:39.700
- [Competitor] Nailed it.

00:06:43.870 --> 00:06:44.910
- Okay.

00:06:44.910 --> 00:06:46.780
Your house is just, it's one level.

00:06:46.780 --> 00:06:49.930
It's like a bachelor pad cabana kind of.

00:06:49.930 --> 00:06:52.490
- I tried to do, um, siding and then uh,

00:06:52.490 --> 00:06:53.700
the elf right here.

00:06:53.700 --> 00:06:55.670
- It seems that your yard is like

00:06:55.670 --> 00:06:57.363
a little haphazard.

00:06:58.730 --> 00:06:59.563
- Nailed it!

00:07:01.199 --> 00:07:02.099
- [Jacques] Uh oh.

00:07:03.329 --> 00:07:04.970
That one is scary, Nicole.

00:07:04.970 --> 00:07:07.420
- [Nicole] I think it
looks like a Pac-Man shark.

00:07:08.672 --> 00:07:10.101
(drum roll)

00:07:10.101 --> 00:07:11.101
- Nailed it!

00:07:12.870 --> 00:07:13.987
- [Nicole] There's a
lot of things going on

00:07:13.987 --> 00:07:17.660
on the cake, like it's a very busy cake.

00:07:17.660 --> 00:07:19.300
Okay let's see this baby blow.

00:07:19.300 --> 00:07:20.250
Activate your cake!

00:07:21.460 --> 00:07:22.433
Ooh.

00:07:23.930 --> 00:07:26.561
- [Jacques] Wow, this is an eruption.

00:07:26.561 --> 00:07:28.487
(drum roll)

00:07:28.487 --> 00:07:30.642
- Oh!
- Nailed it.

00:07:30.642 --> 00:07:32.656
- [Guest Judge] Okay, okay.

00:07:32.656 --> 00:07:33.730
- [Nicole] Oh no!

00:07:33.730 --> 00:07:36.150
- Sadly, baking the
cake in the first place

00:07:36.150 --> 00:07:38.500
was where I started screwing things up.

00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:40.650
But, I just kind of stuck with it

00:07:40.650 --> 00:07:42.510
and kept just trying to add

00:07:42.510 --> 00:07:44.700
as many of the details as I could.

00:07:44.700 --> 00:07:46.863
- This cake has a lot of personality.

00:07:47.860 --> 00:07:49.200
- [Nicole] I like your tablecloth.

00:07:49.200 --> 00:07:51.420
I think underneath the tablecloth,

00:07:51.420 --> 00:07:53.027
the table is a little mushy.

00:07:53.027 --> 00:07:56.197
It's like a fat woman in a mumu, you know.

